# VoiceVision Axiomatic Foundations
# Source: Architecture discussions, design docs

VoiceVision is an offline multimodal AI brick for edge deployment.
- All processing runs locally on the device
- No cloud API calls are made by the core library
- Models run as subprocesses (not linked libraries)
- This is a deliberate architectural constraint for privacy and reliability
- The library is a "lego brick" - reusable component, not an application